GraphScript CLI (gs) v0.1.0
Usage: gs <command> [options]

Commands:
  edit      Interactive graph editor (CLI REPL)
  serve     Start web editor (GUI + HTTP server)
  parse     Parse .gs/.d.gs asset syntax and output syntax summary
  lint      Lint .gs/.d.gs asset syntax and output diagnostics JSON
  project   Project .gs graph block into FlowGraph JSON summary
  patch     Apply tree-sitter-aware .gs text patch operation

Options:
  -i, --input   Input file
  -o, --output  Output file
  -I, --import  Import .d.gs file (can repeat)
  -f, --format  Output format (json|summary)
  -p, --port    HTTP port for serve (default: 8080)
  --op          patch op: add-import|add-node|add-block|add-attribute|connect|disconnect|rename-node|rename-block|set-property
  --graph       Graph block name for project/patch
  --alias       Node alias for patch
  --new-alias   New node alias for rename-node
  --parent-block Parent block name for add-block
  --block-kind  Block kind for add-block
  --block-name  Block name for add-block/rename-block
  --target      Target block/object name for add-attribute
  --attribute   Attribute source for add-attribute
  --from/--to   Connection endpoints for connect/disconnect
  --property    Property path for set-property
  --value       Replacement value for set-property
